  (text "The TVS and capacitors support the 6S protection circuit on f02. The shunt produces a small voltage\nproportional to propulsion current. Separate Kelvin sense wires carry it to the monitor on f05.\nLoad power continues from PROP_PROTECTED through the shunt to PROP_RAW and the f07 connector."
